Naked AC of -7 is far lower than I've ever gotten. At that point you 
have a 1/17 chance of getting another point of AC for every donation. I 
usually stop after about 0, it should be good enough.

IIRC:
AC works differently once it's below 0 (or -1, or something): it reduces 
the damage you take from a hit by a random amount between 0 and -(your 
AC). So every extra bit of negative AC reduces the damage taken per hit 
by half a point... not very much if you're already getting an average of 
30 points damage reduction.

Here's a hint though if you want to keep donataing: If you've got a way 
to charm monsters, and a way to poly yourself, change into a leprechaun 
and hit the priest a few times. He'll go hostile, but you can charm him 
back to peaceful with the spell/scroll/harp/whatever. If he's holding a 
lot of gold you'll be getting a LOT back each hit.

